      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat asked for headphones the way they're supposed to on android. \n\nThe real problem is between you and your samsung phone. There should be a list of usb devices, or a reset button that will make you choose again for all usb devices.\n\nI would recommend seeking advice from somewhere who understands your particular phone. Asking in here people might ask for the specific phone model and then ask chatgpt for the answer, if you do this yourself, time is saved :)",
